{
  "job_B17.1_20251003_114356": {
    "chunk_text": "& w\u00e6s \u00fea on Cent, & \u00fea scipu foran be su\u00f0an east \u00dea wende se here \u00fe\u00e6t his fultumes se m\u00e6sta d\u00e6l w\u00e6re on \u00fe\u00e6m scipum, & \u00fe\u00e6t hie mehten faran \u00dea geascade se cyng \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t hie ut on herga\u00f0 foron, \u00fea sende he his fird \u00e6g\u00f0er ge of West Seaxum Her gefor \u00e6\u00f0ered ealdormon on Mercum; & Eadweard cyng feng to Lundenbyrg & to Oxnaforda, & Her on \u00feys geare ymb Martines m\u00e6ssan het Eadweard cyning atimbran \u00fea nor\u00f0ran burg \u00e6t & \u00fea \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6s on sumera.betweox gangdagum & middum sumera, \u00fea for Eadweard cyning & him beag god d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s folces to \u00fee \u00e6r under Deniscra manna anwalde w\u00e6ron, & sum his fultum Her on \u00feys gere rad se here ut ofer Eastron of Hamtune, & of Ligeraceastre.& br\u00e6con \u00feone fri\u00fe.& & \u00fea swi\u00f0e ra\u00fee \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m, swa \u00fea o\u00fere ham comon, \u00fea fundon hie o\u00fere flocrade, \u00fe\u00e6t rad ut wi\u00f0 Her on \u00feysum geare com micel sciphere hider ofer su\u00fean of Lidwiccum, & twegen eorlas mid, & gefengon Cameleac biscop on Ircinga felda, & l\u00e6ddon hine mid him to scipum, & \u00fea aliesde \u00dea \u00e6fter \u00feam for se here eall up, & wolde faran \u00fea giet on herga\u00fe wi\u00f0 Ircingafeldes; \u00fea gemetton \u00fea & ofslogon \u00feone eorl Hroald & \u00fe\u00e6s o\u00feres eorles bro\u00feor Ohteres, & micel \u00fe\u00e6s heres.",
